Oct 02 10:01:15 server sshd: Failed password for admin from 192.168.1.50
Oct 02 10:01:20 server sshd: Failed password for admin from 192.168.1.50
Oct 02 10:02:01 server sshd: Accepted password for admin from 192.168.1.50
