# 13. IOC Identification

During triage, record possible indicators.

Example:

```text
Source IP:
192.168.1.50

Username:
admin

Target:
Linux-Server-01

Service:
SSH

Timestamp:
10:01–10:02
```

Possible IOC categories:

```text
IP address
Username
Hostname
Domain
URL
File hash
Process
Filename
Port
```

Remember:

> Not every unusual value is automatically an IOC.

It becomes meaningful when supported by investigation evidence.

